WEBVTT

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.455
S C R W...

00:00:15.455 --> 00:00:17.390
Start up voltages confirmed.

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:19.392
All systems green.

00:00:19.392 --> 00:00:21.094
Awaiting your next order.

00:00:21.094 --> 00:00:22.595
Activate.

00:00:22.595 --> 00:00:23.653
Understood.

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:45.752
We're back!

00:00:45.752 --> 00:00:48.922
Man, the RUC building's a mess.

00:00:48.922 --> 00:00:51.024
Seems there was some sort of accident.

00:00:51.024 --> 00:00:52.025
Accident?

00:00:52.025 --> 00:00:53.693
Oh? Who is this?

00:00:53.693 --> 00:00:55.328
I'll explain later.

00:00:55.328 --> 00:00:58.498
Bro, were you the one
who got rid of the guys outside?

00:00:58.498 --> 00:01:00.734
The surveillance guys were gone.

00:01:00.734 --> 00:01:02.769
That was your doing, right?

00:01:02.769 --> 00:01:04.838
They were gone?

00:01:04.838 --> 00:01:05.905
Oh!

00:01:05.905 --> 00:01:09.102
Just a while ago,
when Integra came back...

00:01:15.181 --> 00:01:16.683
They're coming!

00:01:16.683 --> 00:01:17.877
Time to run!

00:01:28.695 --> 00:01:36.436
You know the continuation of
the fairy tale I've wanted to hear about?

00:01:36.436 --> 00:01:42.898
If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand

00:01:44.611 --> 00:01:54.587
It's like we were both seeking
a coincidence that was off by a page

00:01:54.587 --> 00:01:56.756
And that's how fate brought us together

00:01:56.756 --> 00:02:04.898
More than those words
that you once kept to yourself

00:02:04.898 --> 00:02:13.840
It's the kindness
that made you keep them to yourself

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:20.747
That I want to have faith in now

00:02:20.747 --> 00:02:28.488
You know, we'll be living
alongside uncertainty from now on

00:02:28.488 --> 00:02:34.894
We used to have nothing to lose,
but that's not us now

00:02:34.894 --> 00:02:42.602
You know the continuation of
the fairy tale I didn't know about before?

00:02:42.602 --> 00:02:48.908
If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand

00:02:48.908 --> 00:02:52.810
It's something to build up bit by bit

00:03:00.687 --> 00:03:03.323
"The Time for Truth"

00:03:03.323 --> 00:03:04.624
"The Time for Truth"
Captain!

00:03:04.624 --> 00:03:05.181
"The Time for Truth"

00:03:05.456 --> 00:03:08.759
We searched through every room,
but they're nowhere to be found!

00:03:08.759 --> 00:03:10.060
The place is empty.

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:12.596
They had no way out.
Do whatever it takes to find them!

00:03:12.596 --> 00:03:13.392
Yes, Sir!

00:03:15.032 --> 00:03:18.160
Damn it! Where are they hiding?

00:03:23.073 --> 00:03:27.211
Sheesh! We just got back,
and it's out the door again!

00:03:27.211 --> 00:03:28.879
Let it go.

00:03:28.879 --> 00:03:31.882
Solty will be all right, won't she?

00:03:31.882 --> 00:03:33.183
Probably.

00:03:33.183 --> 00:03:35.085
Joseph!

00:03:35.085 --> 00:03:37.855
You can save her, right?

00:03:37.855 --> 00:03:39.015
Yeah.

00:03:40.924 --> 00:03:42.593
Where're we going?

00:03:42.593 --> 00:03:45.129
Just follow me.

00:03:45.129 --> 00:03:46.960
What the hell is the deal here?!

00:03:54.405 --> 00:03:58.742
You said we immigrated to the planet...

00:03:58.742 --> 00:04:03.047
You probably can't believe
that we moved here...

00:04:03.047 --> 00:04:08.085
But you can see signs of it
all over this city.

00:04:08.085 --> 00:04:11.522
- Young lady, do you know
how this city began?
- What?

00:04:11.522 --> 00:04:12.890
Let me think...

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:15.693
Not you!

00:04:15.693 --> 00:04:17.695
We learned that in school!

00:04:17.695 --> 00:04:22.866
Our ancestors came to this land from
another city and built this one, right?

00:04:22.866 --> 00:04:24.134
That's right.

00:04:24.134 --> 00:04:29.506
Now, where is the original city where
our ancestors were supposedly from?

00:04:29.506 --> 00:04:30.974
What's it called?

00:04:30.974 --> 00:04:33.210
Why don't we have any
interaction with that city?

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.646
I don't know! We haven't learned that!

00:04:35.646 --> 00:04:36.447
Right.

00:04:36.447 --> 00:04:39.483
Or rather, they haven't taught you.

00:04:39.483 --> 00:04:41.085
What?

00:04:41.085 --> 00:04:43.320
Look at this underground city.

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:45.255
If we came from another city,

00:04:45.255 --> 00:04:48.125
why is a place like this necessary?

00:04:48.125 --> 00:04:52.763
Why is there a city we once used
in the past under the ground?

00:04:52.763 --> 00:04:56.500
Well, to protect us
from something, maybe?

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.769
From what?

00:04:58.769 --> 00:05:00.337
I don't know.

00:05:00.337 --> 00:05:03.774
Wouldn't it make sense
if you think of it this way?

00:05:03.774 --> 00:05:07.211
People need air to live.

00:05:07.211 --> 00:05:10.180
The people who landed on this
airless planet dug underground,

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:14.752
where they lived until a
stable atmosphere was formed.

00:05:14.752 --> 00:05:18.155
This underground city is that place.

00:05:18.155 --> 00:05:21.024
Then, after a time,
when the atmosphere stabilized,

00:05:21.024 --> 00:05:24.027
the people moved above ground.

00:05:24.027 --> 00:05:29.900
As people sought fresh air,
open spaces, and sunlight,

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:32.369
they discarded the underground city.

00:05:32.369 --> 00:05:34.838
That does make sense, but...

00:05:34.838 --> 00:05:37.408
So what're you getting at?!

00:05:37.408 --> 00:05:43.904
This underground city was built using
the ship the first colonists came on.

00:05:49.553 --> 00:05:53.421
And this is part of that original ship.

00:06:00.831 --> 00:06:03.391
I never knew a place like this existed!

00:06:13.744 --> 00:06:15.879
You can fix her up with this thing?

00:06:15.879 --> 00:06:20.751
It was originally used to repair the
ship's parts and integrated circuits,

00:06:20.751 --> 00:06:25.989
but only with this identical technology
can Solty be completely repaired.

00:06:25.989 --> 00:06:27.958
What do you mean by identical technology?

00:06:27.958 --> 00:06:33.363
Solty was built using the same
technology that built this ship.

00:06:33.363 --> 00:06:34.591
What?!

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:54.349
Miss?

00:06:56.153 --> 00:06:57.855
Is something wrong?

00:06:57.855 --> 00:06:58.922
What?

00:06:58.922 --> 00:07:00.924
Oh, it's nothing.

00:07:00.924 --> 00:07:02.392
I'm okay.

00:07:02.392 --> 00:07:06.230
Okay! I'm glad!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:07.297
Watch your step.

00:07:07.297 --> 00:07:09.399
I will!

00:07:09.399 --> 00:07:11.196
Seems she's taken a liking to you.

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:15.572
Just for being unregistered residents,

00:07:15.572 --> 00:07:18.775
those children are forced to live
where the sun never shines.

00:07:18.775 --> 00:07:20.911
They have no access to
an education or social security.

00:07:20.911 --> 00:07:24.414
They have only a
limited future in this place.

00:07:24.414 --> 00:07:29.086
Rose and the two of us fought
for the future of the people living here.

00:07:29.086 --> 00:07:33.423
I doubt a former RUC employee
could understand how we feel!

00:07:33.423 --> 00:07:34.958
I do understand.

00:07:34.958 --> 00:07:38.121
Because I was just like her, too.

00:07:43.767 --> 00:07:45.435
I'm sorry.

00:07:45.435 --> 00:07:50.304
Even so, there's still something
I simply must do.

00:07:51.842 --> 00:07:56.713
Continuing our coverage of the RUC
Security Department murder,

00:07:56.713 --> 00:07:59.483
one of the suspects, Integra Martel,

00:07:59.483 --> 00:08:02.753
was arrested yesterday
inside the RUC building.

00:08:02.753 --> 00:08:05.255
Following a struggle with
security personal arriving on the scene,

00:08:05.255 --> 00:08:10.060
Integra was critically wounded and
is currently being held at a hospital.

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:12.162
Also, the following
five individuals are thought

00:08:12.162 --> 00:08:14.665
to be aiding the fugitive Accela Warrick,
who is still at large,

00:08:14.665 --> 00:08:19.336
and investigation headquarters
has issued warrants for them as well.

00:08:19.336 --> 00:08:23.073
- Roy Revant.
- This can't be!
They issued warrants for us, too?!

00:08:23.073 --> 00:08:24.241
- Roy Revant.
- Mom...

00:08:24.241 --> 00:08:26.376
- Miranda Maverick.
- It'll be all right, Kasha.

00:08:26.376 --> 00:08:29.646
- Miranda Maverick.
- Hey, isn't it about time you told us?

00:08:29.646 --> 00:08:34.384
- Yuto K. Steel.
- What is Ashley up to,
and how much do you know?

00:08:34.384 --> 00:08:35.586
Larry Anderson.

00:08:35.586 --> 00:08:36.687
I suppose you're right.

00:08:36.687 --> 00:08:38.088
Larry Anderson.

00:08:38.088 --> 00:08:43.185
- Andy Anderson.
- But to do that, I'll need to begin by
explaining how things work in this city.

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:58.575
Maintenance complete.

00:08:58.575 --> 00:09:00.702
Switching to awakening mode.

00:09:22.165 --> 00:09:24.434
How are you feeling, Rose?

00:09:24.434 --> 00:09:25.902
Not too bad.

00:09:25.902 --> 00:09:27.838
Everything is in place.

00:09:27.838 --> 00:09:30.273
The rest is up to you.

00:09:30.273 --> 00:09:33.744
Before we begin, I want you
to let me meet someone.

00:09:33.744 --> 00:09:35.177
Who?

00:09:36.213 --> 00:09:38.306
Our enemy.

00:09:51.962 --> 00:09:54.331
This is our enemy.

00:09:54.331 --> 00:09:56.967
It's name is Eunomia.

00:09:56.967 --> 00:09:58.468
So, this is...

00:09:58.468 --> 00:10:01.038
It is the nexus of our city,

00:10:01.038 --> 00:10:04.064
and also the RUC's core computer.

00:10:05.475 --> 00:10:08.979
Eunomia has functioned
as the city's control computer

00:10:08.979 --> 00:10:12.115
since we first immigrated to this planet.

00:10:12.115 --> 00:10:18.021
Eunomia has complete control
of the city's energy and water supplies.

00:10:18.021 --> 00:10:20.490
You might call it the city's lifeline.

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:22.559
Eunomia is the control computer

00:10:22.559 --> 00:10:25.762
tasked with keeping
human beings from extinction.

00:10:25.762 --> 00:10:31.201
But people cannot be controlled
with only energy and water.

00:10:31.201 --> 00:10:38.809
So Eunomia created the RUC
as the city's central entity.

00:10:38.809 --> 00:10:45.282
As Eunomia's proxy, the RUC
manages humanity and runs society.

00:10:45.282 --> 00:10:47.718
It's a corporation that
also acts as the government.

00:10:47.718 --> 00:10:49.352
And through the RUC,

00:10:49.352 --> 00:10:53.557
Eunomia established the
resident registration system.

00:10:53.557 --> 00:10:56.793
It's the chief culprit behind the
creation of unregistered residents.

00:10:56.793 --> 00:10:58.562
Why did it create such a system?

00:10:58.562 --> 00:11:02.232
As the human population grows,
it creates various problems.

00:11:02.232 --> 00:11:06.870
Energy consumption, food supplies,
medical treatment, welfare...

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:10.240
It uses the system
to regulate the population.

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:13.376
To maintain a population where it can
guarantee that supply meets demand.

00:11:13.376 --> 00:11:14.444
That's terrible!

00:11:14.444 --> 00:11:16.913
People have negative feelings.

00:11:16.913 --> 00:11:20.117
Feelings of superiority,
selfishness, cruelty...

00:11:20.117 --> 00:11:23.453
A desire to stand above others.

00:11:23.453 --> 00:11:26.623
By deliberately creating a lower caste,

00:11:26.623 --> 00:11:29.526
Eunomia reduces the discontent
of the upper caste.

00:11:29.526 --> 00:11:32.629
That's so absurd!
So many suffered just for that?!

00:11:32.629 --> 00:11:38.135
And now, Eunomia is trying to
further control humanity directly.

00:11:38.135 --> 00:11:40.660
- What?!
- By using this.

00:11:45.041 --> 00:11:46.543
Resemble...

00:11:46.543 --> 00:11:51.648
This is a terminal that connects
human beings directly to Eunomia.

00:11:51.648 --> 00:11:54.617
Of course, this has not
been revealed to anyone.

00:11:58.088 --> 00:12:00.724
Why?

00:12:00.724 --> 00:12:05.595
Why do you know what
no one else has been told?

00:12:05.595 --> 00:12:08.765
And the other day,
you walked right into an area

00:12:08.765 --> 00:12:11.401
that even top executives
can't access!

00:12:11.401 --> 00:12:14.871
Just who are you, really?

00:12:14.871 --> 00:12:17.140
Since we first immigrated here
200 years ago,

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:21.511
I've watched over the direction
of society as Eunomia's agent.

00:12:21.511 --> 00:12:23.103
I am the last of the overseers.

00:12:24.481 --> 00:12:27.784
Th-Then the creation of the
resident registration system was...

00:12:27.784 --> 00:12:29.619
...partly my doing.

00:12:29.619 --> 00:12:31.822
And now you're going
to destroy it yourself?

00:12:31.822 --> 00:12:35.725
I want to correct my mistake.

00:12:35.725 --> 00:12:37.928
Let's change it together, Rose.

00:12:37.928 --> 00:12:39.396
With our hands,

00:12:39.396 --> 00:12:43.433
let's change this world
shackled by a machine!

00:12:43.433 --> 00:12:45.264
With our hands...

00:12:48.705 --> 00:12:53.143
So, what is Ashley intending
to do to this Eunomia?

00:12:53.143 --> 00:12:56.738
He's trying to turn it off.
Of that, I'm certain.

00:12:58.014 --> 00:13:01.318
If he does that,
there'll be no energy or water!

00:13:01.318 --> 00:13:03.820
He won't be able to survive, either!

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:06.223
But that's what he wants.

00:13:06.223 --> 00:13:10.827
Ashley has despised being controlled
by a machine for a long time now.

00:13:10.827 --> 00:13:12.295
For a long time?

00:13:12.295 --> 00:13:15.565
I was once Ashley's colleague.

00:13:15.565 --> 00:13:16.666
What?!

00:13:16.666 --> 00:13:21.037
But we had a parting of the ways.

00:13:21.037 --> 00:13:22.937
Roy, what do you think of this?

00:13:24.307 --> 00:13:27.878
As expected, it's hard to
take this all on faith, but...

00:13:27.878 --> 00:13:28.879
But?

00:13:28.879 --> 00:13:32.515
It's too plausible to simply laugh off?

00:13:32.515 --> 00:13:37.320
And I can't believe that man will be
satisfied with simply turning it off.

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:38.688
Meaning?

00:13:38.688 --> 00:13:41.458
Is he planning on becoming
a dictator or something?

00:13:41.458 --> 00:13:42.857
Who knows?

00:13:45.028 --> 00:13:47.464
There's one other thing that bothers me.

00:13:47.464 --> 00:13:49.699
What's that?

00:13:49.699 --> 00:13:50.800
Rose.

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:51.824
What?

00:13:54.671 --> 00:13:58.129
I don't understand how Rose
is involved in all this.

00:14:01.344 --> 00:14:04.447
In truth, I knew...

00:14:04.447 --> 00:14:10.053
In truth, I knew why Rose was necessary.

00:14:10.053 --> 00:14:14.820
Because it had to do with
the program that I was a part of.

00:14:27.971 --> 00:14:30.907
Are you ready, Rose?

00:14:30.907 --> 00:14:35.345
There's no way this machine is also
under Eunomia's control, I hope.

00:14:35.345 --> 00:14:36.880
Of course, not.

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:40.216
This system has
no connection with Eunomia.

00:14:40.216 --> 00:14:41.851
I built it from the ground up.

00:14:41.851 --> 00:14:46.790
Though, it took me a long time
precisely because of that.

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:47.390
Rose...

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:49.255
Okay, let's get started.

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:02.932
The program I was a part of...

00:15:09.145 --> 00:15:12.182
...was to use a Proceed's calculating
and processing capabilities

00:15:12.182 --> 00:15:14.980
to link directly with a computer.

00:15:19.556 --> 00:15:21.491
Beginning initial start up.

00:15:21.491 --> 00:15:24.060
Transer bio-patterns confirmed.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:26.262
Pupil constriction ratio green.

00:15:26.262 --> 00:15:27.831
Brain wave pattern green.

00:15:27.831 --> 00:15:29.924
Initiating primary contact.

00:15:32.002 --> 00:15:34.671
Primary contact cleared.

00:15:34.671 --> 00:15:37.196
But it was passed on to Rose as well.

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:43.546
After hearing Joseph's story,
I understand now.

00:15:43.546 --> 00:15:49.753
That man wanted an independent computer
capable of defying Eunomia.

00:15:49.753 --> 00:15:52.517
The Proceed was a substitute for that.

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:57.060
The ability to link directly
with a computer...

00:15:57.060 --> 00:16:00.163
He plans on turning that ability around...

00:16:00.163 --> 00:16:02.766
Preparations complete for final contact.

00:16:02.766 --> 00:16:06.503
All function will subsequently
be transferred to the transer.

00:16:06.503 --> 00:16:07.971
Go ahead.

00:16:07.971 --> 00:16:10.373
...to hack into Eunomia!

00:16:10.373 --> 00:16:11.499
Initiate dive!

00:16:16.980 --> 00:16:22.252
And his plan is to then destroy
Eunomia's cognitive programming

00:16:22.252 --> 00:16:25.789
and turn it into a mere box.

00:16:25.789 --> 00:16:30.658
A mere box that does nothing
but supply energy and water!

00:16:38.902 --> 00:16:42.138
It attacks and sets firewalls
with incredible speed!

00:16:42.138 --> 00:16:45.475
I guess it's not the nexus
of this city for nothing.

00:16:45.475 --> 00:16:47.877
Layer 127 firewall breached.

00:16:47.877 --> 00:16:50.313
Creating anti-virus
for third virus subspecies.

00:16:50.313 --> 00:16:52.649
It's launching attacks!

00:16:52.649 --> 00:16:55.018
Incredible! What speed!

00:16:55.018 --> 00:16:58.021
So this is what a Proceed can do!

00:16:58.021 --> 00:17:00.190
So far, so good.

00:17:00.190 --> 00:17:05.184
All that remains is to see what
resistance Eunomia will put up, but...

00:17:09.432 --> 00:17:11.332
I swear, I will endure it!

00:17:13.770 --> 00:17:16.673
Thank goodness! You're awake!

00:17:16.673 --> 00:17:19.409
Amazing! The repairs really worked!

00:17:19.409 --> 00:17:20.777
Are you all right?

00:17:20.777 --> 00:17:24.447
Is there anywhere that
still doesn't feel right?

00:17:24.447 --> 00:17:25.315
Are you all right?

00:17:25.315 --> 00:17:28.518
Maybe that machine wasn't
right for you, after all?

00:17:28.518 --> 00:17:30.887
Who... are you people?

00:17:30.887 --> 00:17:32.622
What's the matter, Solty?

00:17:32.622 --> 00:17:34.057
You're acting strangely.

00:17:34.057 --> 00:17:35.786
Sol... ty?

00:17:38.561 --> 00:17:40.196
Hurry!

00:17:40.196 --> 00:17:42.265
Get away from this place quickly!

00:17:42.265 --> 00:17:43.357
- What?
- What?
- What?

00:17:51.207 --> 00:17:52.175
Wh-What's going on?

00:17:52.175 --> 00:17:54.711
I don't know. It just
happened all of a sudden!

00:17:54.711 --> 00:17:56.201
Hey, are you okay?

00:17:59.549 --> 00:18:00.850
Thank goodness...

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:03.620
What was that?
Everyone collapsed all at once.

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:05.144
Hey, what just happened?

00:18:08.958 --> 00:18:10.118
What's going on?!

00:18:18.234 --> 00:18:19.802
Division Chief!

00:18:19.802 --> 00:18:21.437
I'll be right back.

00:18:21.437 --> 00:18:22.665
Chief!

00:18:26.075 --> 00:18:28.978
So you've finally begun, Eunomia.

00:18:28.978 --> 00:18:30.946
Control via the resemble parts!

00:18:33.016 --> 00:18:35.785
Damn it! What the hell's going on?!

00:18:35.785 --> 00:18:37.253
What do you guys want?!

00:18:37.253 --> 00:18:38.488
You wanna fight?!

00:18:38.488 --> 00:18:40.080
You must not kill them!

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:48.598
They're resembles!

00:18:48.598 --> 00:18:50.532
Destroy only their resemble parts!

00:18:52.435 --> 00:18:54.370
That's not going to kill them, is it?

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:56.706
They're just unconscious from the shock.

00:18:56.706 --> 00:18:58.408
What's going on here?!

00:18:58.408 --> 00:18:59.509
It's Eunomia!

00:18:59.509 --> 00:19:04.047
Eunomia is using resemble parts
to control people!

00:19:04.047 --> 00:19:05.815
What can we do to stop them?!

00:19:05.815 --> 00:19:07.116
The RUC!

00:19:07.116 --> 00:19:10.353
If we destroy the transmitter on the
wireless tower on the RUC building,

00:19:10.353 --> 00:19:12.455
it won't be able to transmit the signal!

00:19:12.455 --> 00:19:14.889
Yes, that's one way!

00:19:20.563 --> 00:19:23.533
And that's why I'm in here now!

00:19:23.533 --> 00:19:27.230
All pulse and neuro network
connections established.

00:19:31.407 --> 00:19:32.475
That hurts!

00:19:32.475 --> 00:19:34.310
It hurts! It hurts!

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:36.045
Silvia!

00:19:36.045 --> 00:19:37.981
Celica!

00:19:37.981 --> 00:19:40.183
Integra!

00:19:40.183 --> 00:19:42.252
I will do this!

00:19:42.252 --> 00:19:45.688
I will never let that man
get away with this!

00:19:45.688 --> 00:19:47.588
Ashley Lynx!

00:19:52.829 --> 00:19:55.798
What is this? An earthquake?!

00:19:55.798 --> 00:19:58.401
It can't be!

00:19:58.401 --> 00:20:01.704
What is this earthquake?
What's going on?!

00:20:01.704 --> 00:20:03.899
It's as though the ground is being moved!

00:20:06.075 --> 00:20:09.312
The buildings...

00:20:09.312 --> 00:20:10.711
...are shaking.

00:20:44.047 --> 00:20:45.381
It's moving...

00:20:45.381 --> 00:20:47.250
I managed to get it moving.

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:51.087
Now, t-to get revenge...

00:20:51.087 --> 00:20:53.623
...on A-Ashley Lynx.

00:20:53.623 --> 00:20:55.892
- I'll... I'll destroy this and...
- Transer consciousness level dropping.

00:20:55.892 --> 00:20:56.693
Entering danger zone.

00:20:56.693 --> 00:20:59.262
- D-Des... Des... Des... Destroy...
- Self-preservation function activated.

00:20:59.262 --> 00:21:01.059
Injecting forced revival pulse.

00:21:08.438 --> 00:21:09.837
Destroy...

00:21:38.334 --> 00:21:39.460
Miss Accela!

00:21:52.779 --> 00:21:57.550
On a clear day in the park

00:21:57.550 --> 00:22:00.486
Looking up at the sky

00:22:00.486 --> 00:22:08.825
There was a tiny little cloud
that almost vanished

00:22:11.731 --> 00:22:16.502
Letting the wind take us where it will

00:22:16.502 --> 00:22:19.439
We live freely

00:22:19.439 --> 00:22:25.400
We make our way,
walking a little at a time

00:22:27.480 --> 00:22:30.176
We're the same

00:22:32.251 --> 00:22:37.023
This precious time

00:22:37.023 --> 00:22:40.860
Each time we meet

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:50.403
This feeling of not being alone
turns into kindness

00:22:50.403 --> 00:22:56.976
I can turn it into
the courage to believe in someone

00:22:56.976 --> 00:23:09.047
And surely, before I vanish
into the far reaches of that sky...

00:23:15.695 --> 00:23:16.896
Please stop.

00:23:16.896 --> 00:23:17.763
I can't do that.

00:23:17.763 --> 00:23:19.198
I'm sorry.

00:23:19.198 --> 00:23:20.099
Next time,

00:23:20.099 --> 00:23:20.600
"My Feelings, Her Feelings,
and the Girl's Feelings".

00:23:20.600 --> 00:23:22.735
"My Feelings, Her Feelings,
and the Girl's Feelings".

00:23:22.735 --> 00:23:25.371
What is your happiness?
